{"summary":"Explore your kingdom and rule wisely","description":"How to rule wisely and prevent rebellion?\nWhere to find faithful companions?\nHow to survive in a fabulous kingdom full of dangers?\n\nIn the card game Choice of Life: Middle Ages 2, you have to weigh every decision not to die ahead of time! Explore the kingdom from the snowy forests of the north to the endless fields of the south and meet its inhabitants. Rule graciously but firmly, deal with traitors, and do not confuse friends with enemies. Become a great ruler or perish in the annals of history!\n\nKey features:\n\n- Colorful 2D graphics, hundreds of different cards\n- Non-linear storyline where each choice has unique consequences\n- Over a thousand events and 99 ways to die","esrbNotes":"Violence, Blood, Use of Alcohol","pegiNotes":"Mild Swearing","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kce8UwrDIZk?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-t2y_8qFopJhSEb5_B555rmEu5JG2i64jy7JyrhlYf7oyn91h7BNSVku5_4QLp5ZNa05TTgAsb1VRJLbHIQZ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wNNe8bVnHW5yvHOSGhlc_aBtW-lMION61EgPsgh8xIpefNSCVGmX6gspRAn4CAzBA6M-IcUOgUxbWt8Vpk6H","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HMmD6LFKHHh40A6-54GqLaJZ9d4csf5FBC4UsCSmw0RsObIx8YjEJDyR5uXkSbAdbOy2Pwb3vhxglMm2TMPGwg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/x60fQnwlcXXHvyEJuszqQIA-6g5jUDaIFIeiuBCa9SU3N_q7VM0x1TbMr2G6o49pjugf72E6CWDw8bRo4qAH","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ez2Rc7t7mW7vKZQMYPI36NqfkKFocOTM3jJwr9rBRlui7gBekIpzF-zlQxCUTg8ONHQjq29X2YGzGfwCnJro0Q","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PRrcP-eWnAivrlj2ihmpBLZ-2IsAiMXNNus0YkUejf4nPCZRU1nhRIdjhCa4Uexs3GHozZVe6IcYybbfrQmdtdU","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/B0p2xZ8MsIU5zbio12eg2z5EQdSmkCZdCcPOcPN3KAcvh14cHSFqc6Ni-Tb2mGveZztNiDSPOlsCETa_MythOQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wNNe8bVnHW5yvHOSGhlc_aBtW-lMION61EgPsgh8xIpefNSCVGmX6gspRAn4CAzBA6M-IcUOgUxbWt8Vpk6H","https://play-lh.googleuserconte